    ADAPTERS -->|records| POSTGRES
    ADAPTERS -->|artifacts| OBJECT_STORE
    ADAPTERS -->|enqueue| QUEUE
    ADAPTERS <-->|auth| AUTH
    ADAPTERS <-->|request / result| AI_PROVIDER

    CHILD_APP <-.->|Canvas / presence · WS proposed| ADAPTERS
    TEACHER_UI <-.->|Live projection · WS proposed| ADAPTERS
    ADAPTERS -.->|authorized events| APP
    QUEUE -->|claim job| WORKER
    WORKER -->|AI task| ADAPTERS
    WORKER -->|typed result / status| APP

